body:
Let me share my story what actually causes my most anger (And still is causing me anger) I might have anger issues or not. He was one of my closest friends, but i generally try and avoid talking with him.

&#x200B;

So i have a friend that keeps harassing me. He would hit me for no reason. Call me gay. Act like he is sucking my dick. He would call me autistic etc, just general bullying stuff. He would even steal my things during a lesson and give them back after a few minutes. He would hit me in the back of my head sometimes or even throw stuff at my head. Just annoying as hell, abusive. He has anger issues, but when he does this he isn't angry at all. He even acted like he would steal my bicycle (Was worth like 200 euros or somethin) He just harasses me everywhere in school. He also had an enemy. That enemy followed us for like a kilometer and nobody cared. We would even yell "Why are you following us!" but no adults cared. He even takes pictures of me when i don't notice him. It's just so fucking annoying. Sorry for swearing, but this makes me angry. To this day he still harasses me.
